---
# Task names start with the thing they act on, and that is often a lowercase
# identifier (awg0, nf_conntrack, pwa-provisioner). Renaming them to satisfy
# a casing rule would make them harder to find in output.
skip_list:
  - name[casing]
  # verify_problems is shared on purpose: both roles add findings and the
  # playbook reports them once. Inventory-level names (admin_user,
  # monitor_from) are used by more than one role.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
